OL,3,ATurkey steel factory blast kills at
OL,4,Aleast 16 people
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe local governor said the blast
OL,7,Fhappened around midday after a crane
OL,8,Fcarrying a replacement boiler
OL,9,Fcollapsed, causing materials to fall
OL,10,Finto a furnace below.
OL,12,FWorkplace accidents remain a chronic
OL,13,Fproblem in Turkey, the Turkish Health
OL,14,Fand Safety Labor Watch, an independent
OL,15,Fcivil society organisation, said.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
